        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Jozy</strong> is a charming and relaxing game designed to boost your memory and spatial thinking in the coziest way possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your journey as an eager intern and rise through the ranks to become CEO. Along the way, thoughtfully decorate small rooms with furniture and décor to create inviting little havens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play, you'll notice your cognitive skills subtly improving—all while enjoying calming, stress-free gameplay. And don’t worry, you won’t be alone: your playful cat companion is always nearby, watching over your progress with curiosity and charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve gentle spatial puzzles, unlock new decor sets, and find joy in every perfectly placed piece. Cozy Jozy is a wholesome, brain-boosting experience for players of all ages.</p>",
